<p>Unlike U-Net, which is based mainly on convolutions, DiT relies primaril=
y on the Transformer architecture. As shown in Figure 14, DiT consists of f=
our main components:</p>
<ul>
<li>Patchify</li>
<li>Positional encoding</li>
<li>Transformer</li>
<li>Unpatchify</li>
</ul>
