<h3 id=3D"sampling">Sampling</h3>
<p>The sampling process in diffusion models starts with random noise, and t=
he model iteratively denoises the sample until a fully denoised video repre=
sentation in the latent space is obtained. For more details on sampling in =
diffusion models, refer to Chapter 9.</p>
